WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.106
TypeSafe returns a whole outline choice and confidence.

00:00:10.106 --> 00:00:14.154
Our outline handler replies. Application state stays unchanged.

00:00:14.154 --> 00:00:19.912
